{"3486530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Stupid Never Dies", "steam_appid": 3486530, "required_age": "17", "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>SKU Information</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Stupid Never Dies</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/fd744daa59dcc5a1071d013270fa0f81.avif?t=1787894475\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MSRP：US$49.99</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Stupid Never Dies: Glorious Idiot Edition</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/82ba62422a60d055fc80584ee9b59711.avif?t=1787894475\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Items included in this bundle can also be purchased separately. Please be careful not to purchase duplicate items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glorious Idiot Edition set includes </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Stupid Never Dies&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Stupid Never Dies&quot; In-game item &quot;TickTock Teddies: Nonsense Overload Pack&quot;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MSRP：US$59.99</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Stupid Never Dies - In-game item &quot;TickTock Teddies: Nonsense Overload Pack&quot;</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/5737a277f0b4944d4d4a1e6590cb35a4.avif?t=1787894475\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A DLC pack of TickTock Teddies usable in the base game, with exclusive special effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MSRP：US$11.99</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Original TickTock Teddy 1: &quot;Big Head&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     Davy gets a bobble head, and the combat music becomes a remix.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Original TickTock Teddy 2: &quot;Chirp Chirp&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     Footstep sounds in Zombie Style get a special gimmick, and the home track becomes a remix.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Original TickTock Teddy 3: &quot;Festival&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     Hit sounds in Davy Burst gain a special gimmick, and the Davy Burst track becomes a remix.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Original TickTock Teddy 4: &quot;Romantic&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     The graffiti effect during Davy Burst gains a special gimmick, and the Davy Burst track becomes the theme song.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Original TickTock Teddy 5: &quot;Splash&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     The level-up effect gains a special gimmick, and the Hurry Up track becomes a remix.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>◾️ What Is Stupid Never Dies?</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bite, Rip, Rise!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control Davy, the weakest zombie imaginable, and battle through a mysterious dungeon to defeat KOM, the King of Monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every dive makes Davy grow stronger faster. Customize his body, devour powerful monsters, steal their abilities, and race against time to conquer the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by GPTRACK50, a studio founded by veteran action game developers, Stupid Never Dies is a unique single-player 3D action RPG combining fast-paced growth, bizarre humor, and stylish action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/c7d92dcf8179f5b4366746ef25184f43.poster.avif?t=1787894475\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/c7d92dcf8179f5b4366746ef25184f43.webm?t=1787894475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/c7d92dcf8179f5b4366746ef25184f43.mp4?t=1787894475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>◾️ A bizarre tale of love and ruin</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Davy, a timid zombie, falls in love at first sight with Julia, a college girl frozen to death during the Great War.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To bring her back to life, he must defeat KOM, recover humanity’s lost knowledge, and survive the dungeon’s deadly depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can the weakest zombie save the girl he loves—and maybe the world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/43fd950e31306d0d264eeec0f66b5853.poster.avif?t=1787894475\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/43fd950e31306d0d264eeec0f66b5853.webm?t=1787894475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/43fd950e31306d0d264eeec0f66b5853.mp4?t=1787894475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>◾️ Funky zombie action</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Style Eat</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat elite monsters, consume their cores, and steal their powers. Transform into 11 unique Styles, including Werewolf, Harpy, Golem, Vampire, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Body Hack</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replace Davy’s body parts with powerful Overtech gear to boost stats and unlock new Active and Passive Skills. Fight your way with endless build combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Davy Burst</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash Davy’s imagination to temporarily transform reality and dramatically boost all of his abilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/67b655def39b00ab3fcb08474422bb2a.poster.avif?t=1787894475\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/67b655def39b00ab3fcb08474422bb2a.webm?t=1787894475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/67b655def39b00ab3fcb08474422bb2a.mp4?t=1787894475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>◾️ Overtech monsters</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle classic monsters enhanced by Overtech, including werewolves, vampires, harpies, lizardmen, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different weapons, armor, and abilities make every encounter fresh and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>◾️ Main Characters</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/3563014393ac36fcf16bbae79e646cf4.avif?t=1787894475\" width=1200 height=300 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Davy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The weakest zombie in existence. Mocked by monsters and humans alike, he enters the dungeon to save Julia and prove himself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Julia</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A college student who died inside a shopping mall freezer during the Great War. Davy falls in love the moment he finds her.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dr. Frank</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brilliant but obsessive scientist who guides Davy’s journey while pursuing his own ambitions.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>◾️ What Is Stupid Never Dies?</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bite, Rip, Rise!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control Davy, the weakest zombie imaginable, and battle through a mysterious dungeon to defeat KOM, the King of Monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every dive makes Davy grow stronger faster. Customize his body, devour powerful monsters, steal their abilities, and race against time to conquer the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by GPTRACK50, a studio founded by veteran action game developers, Stupid Never Dies is a unique single-player 3D action RPG combining fast-paced growth, bizarre humor, and stylish action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/c7d92dcf8179f5b4366746ef25184f43.poster.avif?t=1787894475\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/c7d92dcf8179f5b4366746ef25184f43.webm?t=1787894475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/c7d92dcf8179f5b4366746ef25184f43.mp4?t=1787894475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>◾️ A bizarre tale of love and ruin</strong></u>